WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:20.427
Coby: Mom, can I call Uncle Mike tonight?

2
00:00:20.428 --> 00:00:23.404
Mrs. Rock: Sure. Why?

3
00:00:23.405 --> 00:00:27.007
Coby: I want to invite him to Career Day.

4
00:00:27.008 --> 00:00:30.733
Coby: He came last year to talk about being a firefighter.

5
00:00:30.734 --> 00:00:33.123
Coby: It was great!

6
00:00:33.124 --> 00:00:38.589
Mrs. Rock: I'm sure he'd love to come again.

7
00:00:38.590 --> 00:00:42.014
Miss Gray: I have good news, boys and girls.

8
00:00:42.015 --> 00:00:44.423
Daisy: Is it about Career Day?

9
00:00:44.424 --> 00:00:49.291
Miss Gray: No. A new student is joining our class.

10
00:00:49.292 --> 00:00:54.077
Class: Ooh! Yay!

11
00:00:54.078 --> 00:01:02.315
Mr. Miller: Good morning, Room Two.

12
00:01:02.316 --> 00:01:04.726
This is Greg.

13
00:01:04.727 --> 00:01:07.345
Class: Hi, Greg!

14
00:01:07.346 --> 00:01:09.082
Greg: Hi.

15
00:01:09.083 --> 00:01:12.095
Coby: Miss Gray, can Greg sit here?

16
00:01:12.096 --> 00:01:17.673
Miss Gray: Okay, Coby. You can help Greg learn all about our school.

17
00:01:17.674 --> 00:01:21.677
Mark: I'll help too.

18
00:01:21.678 --> 00:01:24.467
Mark: Miss Gray is a really nice teacher.

19
00:01:24.468 --> 00:01:27.474
Coby: She tells us funny stories. And she—

20
00:01:27.475 --> 00:01:31.166
Greg: Hey, Mark. Who's that?

21
00:01:31.167 --> 00:01:34.413
Mark: He's my favorite baseball player.

22
00:01:34.414 --> 00:01:36.340
Greg: I like baseball too!

23
00:01:36.341 --> 00:01:38.415
Coby: I play basketball.

24
00:01:38.416 --> 00:01:40.673
Greg: Basketball is boring.

25
00:01:40.674 --> 00:01:53.794
I like baseball much better.

26
00:01:53.795 --> 00:01:57.248
Coby: Hey, Mark! Want to play basketball?

27
00:01:57.249 --> 00:02:01.201
Mark: No, thanks. I'm going to play kickball with Greg.

28
00:02:01.202 --> 00:02:04.712
Coby: Oh . . . Jim, want to play basketball with me?

29
00:02:04.713 --> 00:02:13.726
Jim: I think I'll play kickball today too.

30
00:02:13.727 --> 00:02:17.291
Miss Gray: Thanks for helping Greg on his first day, Coby.

31
00:02:17.292 --> 00:02:19.218
Coby: You're welcome.

32
00:02:19.219 --> 00:02:22.348
Miss Gray: I think he was glad to make new friends.

33
00:02:22.349 --> 00:02:25.227
Miss Gray: It's hard to be the new kid at school.

34
00:02:25.228 --> 00:02:30.110
Coby: He seems to be doing just fine!
